# Raw real-data source files (dataset/raw/MOSDAC/, dataset/raw/*.nc). These
# are large (100s of MB to approximately 800 MB each) and are excluded
# from version control. The derived, compact JSON (public/data_real.json)
# is committed instead; provenance and checksums for the raw files are
# committed in dataset/PROVENANCE.md and dataset/raw/CHECKSUMS.sha256.
# See dataset/README.md for the full layout and a download link.
# Regenerate locally with: python -m real.export_real_data
MOSDAC/
*.nc

# Internal working document (development log / handoff notes). Kept
# locally for reference; intentionally excluded from version control.
PROJECT_REPORT.txt
.env*
